# 📄 ResumePulse AI — Intelligent Resume & ATS Analyzer

> An AI-powered resume analysis tool designed to help candidates optimize their resumes for MNC profiles using Google Gemini and Natural Language Processing (NLP).

🌐 **Live Demo:** [resume-analyzer-steel-one.vercel.app](https://resume-analyzer-steel-one.vercel.app)

---

## 🚀 Features

- **Document Parsing:** Supports PDF and DOCX resume uploads.
- **MNC Profile Matching:** Analyzes resumes against criteria tailored for top tech companies and MNC standards.
- **ATS Keyword Gap Analysis:** Identifies missing keywords, action verbs, and skill gaps using LLM capabilities.
- **Actionable Feedback:** Provides structured scoring, section-by-section recommendations, and improvement tips.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend / Framework:** Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS
- **AI / LLM Integration:** Google Gemini API
- **Deployment:** Vercel

